                                        rdfs:label "emit_provenance (slot)" ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Whether to emit provenance sidecars alongside results. Unset means enabled. Named apart from the ``provenance`` slot carrying PROV-O metadata (Network, Figure, ...): LinkML maps every slot of a given name onto one property, so a boolean here and a ``Provenance`` object there would make ``tvbo:provenance`` both an owl:DatatypeProperty and an owl:ObjectProperty — not OWL-DL." ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "emit_provenance" .


