###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/DenseDelayGraph
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DenseDelayGraph> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                        rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing ;
                                        rdfs:comment "Dense adjacency with a delay-history buffer, used when any coupling carries a conduction delay and graph_representation resolves to dense. Required for interpolated (differentiable) delays (§4.1b)."@en ;
                                        rdfs:label "DenseDelayGraph"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/DenseGraph
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DenseGraph> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                   rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing ;
                                   rdfs:comment "Dense adjacency, instantaneous coupling. Used when graph_representation resolves to dense and no coupling carries a conduction delay."@en ;
                                   rdfs:label "DenseGraph"@en .


