###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ConnectivityRule#all_to_all
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ConnectivityRule#all_to_all> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                    rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ConnectivityRule> ;
                                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/struct> ;
                                                    rdfs:label "all_to_all (ConnectivityRule)" ;
                                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Fully connected projection: every source cell connects to every target cell. For a self-projection (same source and target population) the diagonal i->i is governed by the Edge's allow_self_connections flag." ;
                                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "all_to_all" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ConnectivityRule#one_to_one
