                                              <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/eventPort> "relay" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnection
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnection> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                     rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing ;
