                                         <https://w3id.org/tvbo/realisedByBackend> "tvboptim" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelJansen1995
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelJansen1995> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                 <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Dynamics> ;
