###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                          <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> ;
                                                                 <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060079> ,
