###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                   <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> ;
