###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/parameters/E_L_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/parameters/E_L_e> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                              <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> ;
