###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/parameters/tau_OU
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/parameters/tau_OU> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> ;
                                                                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "time constant noise" ;
