###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/parameters/tau_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/parameters/tau_e> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                               <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> ;
