###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/parameters/tau_w_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/parameters/tau_w_i> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
